T:Schumann’s Missing Symphony
T:II. Romanze: Andante
C:Claude (AI), in the manner of Robert Schumann
M:3/4
L:1/8
Q:"Andante" 1/4=63
%%score [fl ob cl bn] [hn tbn] [v1 v2 va vc cb]
% Original AI-composed homage. The score is written at sounding pitch.
